{"id": "q0100", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2864504703, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Let $P(x)$ be a monic polynomial of degree 3.  Suppose that $P(x)$ has remainder $R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 1)(x - 4),$ and remainder $2R(x)$ when it is divided by $(x - 2)(x - 3).$  Given that $P(0) = 5,$ find $P(5).$\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0100.wav", "input_sha256": "ab5f7dfd82d334d2d9b35be513f0c0abf804686972b49c48cebc9877ea20b032", "input_samples": 271400, "input_s": 16.962, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.8784, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So, we have a monic poly nomial of degree 3, p of x. And when it's divided by x minus 1 times x minus 4, the remainder is r of x. And when it' s divided by x minus 3, the remainder is 2r of x. We are also given that p of 0 equals 5, and we need to find p of 5. Let's start with what we know about division. Since p of x has a remainder of r of x when divided by x minus 1 times x minus 4, and these are both linear factors, r of x must be a constant or a quadratic polynomial at most. But since the divisor is quadratic, the remainder can be at most degree 1 less than the divisor, so r of x is a constant. Let's call that constant c. So, p of x equal s some quotient q of x times x minus 1 times x minus 4 plus c. Now, let's use the other condition. When p of x is divided by x minus 3, the remainder is 2 c. That means, by the Remainder The orem, p of 3 equals 2 c. Let' s plug in x equals 3 into our expression for p of x. P of 3 is q of 3 times 3 minus 1 times 3", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 17, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 60, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0100_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "3612aa74ecdfee0ba55108b1c7781687e1b75e32d2542c239c84b0e5ccd8b045", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 60.0}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.053, 1.094, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.054, 2.095, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.053, 3.094, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.054, 4.097, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.059, 5.107, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.059, 6.107, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.058, 7.106, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.059, 8.108, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.056, 9.101, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.06, 10.109, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.06, 11.109, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.06, 12.109, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.058, 13.103, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.058, 14.104, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.06, 15.105, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.062, 16.11, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 16.962, 17.023, 17.072, 1, 0, 0], [17, 0, 17.962, 18.023, 18.628, 0, 24000, 0], [18, 0, 18.962, 19.025, 19.699, 0, 24000, 0], [19, 0, 19.962, 20.025, 20.575, 0, 24000, 0], [20, 0, 20.962, 21.028, 21.628, 0, 24000, 0], [21, 0, 21.962, 22.026, 22.603, 0, 24000, 0], [22, 0, 22.962, 23.025, 23.574, 0, 24000, 0], [23, 0, 23.962, 24.026, 24.577, 0, 24000, 0], [24, 0, 24.962, 25.025, 25.6, 0, 24000, 0], [25, 0, 25.962, 26.024, 26.628, 0, 24000, 0], [26, 0, 26.962, 27.024, 27.481, 0, 24000, 0], [27, 0, 27.962, 28.026, 28.605, 0, 24000, 0], [28, 0, 28.962, 29.027, 29.581, 0, 24000, 0], [29, 0, 29.962, 30.024, 30.487, 0, 24000, 0], [30, 0, 30.962, 31.023, 31.584, 0, 24000, 0], [31, 0, 31.962, 32.02, 32.562, 0, 24000, 0], [32, 0, 32.962, 33.021, 33.619, 0, 24000, 0], [33, 0, 33.962, 34.024, 34.539, 0, 24000, 0], [34, 0, 34.962, 35.024, 35.637, 0, 24000, 0], [3