{"id": "q0149", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3071058655, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "If we write $\\sqrt{2}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt{2}} + \\sqrt{3} + \\frac{1}{\\sqrt{3}}$ in the form $\\dfrac{a\\sqrt{2} + b\\sqrt{3}}{c}$ such that $a$, $b$, and $c$ are positive integers and $c$ is as small as possible, then what is $a+b+c$?\n\nSolve and give the final answer.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0149.wav", "input_sha256": "1aba5f1aa218ea4829a3402ef44d24088c12e578440003f61eac5b024f65f75e", "input_samples": 267400, "input_s": 16.712, "n_real_chunks": 17, "score": 0.9319, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": true, "mode": "escalated", "answer": "", "relay_text": "Assuming the expression is \\[ \\sqrt2+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}, \\] we simplify: \\[ \\frac{1}{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3}=\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2 \\] So, \\[ \\sqrt2+(\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2)+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2} = \\sqrt3+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2} \\] \\[ = \\frac{\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt3}{2} \\] Thus \\(a=1,\\ b=2,\\ c=2\\), so \\[ a+b+c=1+2+2=5 \\] Answer: 5", "expert_answer": "Assuming the expression is\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt2+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3}+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2},\n\\]\n\nwe simplify:\n\n\\[\n\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2+\\sqrt3}=\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2\n\\]\n\nSo,\n\n\\[\n\\sqrt2+(\\sqrt3-\\sqrt2)+\\frac{1}{\\sqrt2}\n= \\sqrt3+\\frac{\\sqrt2}{2}\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= \\frac{\\sqrt2+2\\sqrt3}{2}\n\\]\n\nThus \\(a=1,\\ b=2,\\ c=2\\), so\n\n\\[\na+b+c=1+2+2=5\n\\]\n\n**Answer: 5**", "transcript": "If we write a squirt 2 plus frac 1 squirt 2 plus squirt 3 plus frac 1 squirt in the form d frac d frac a squirt 2 plus b 3 c dollar such that positive integers and c dollar is as small as possible, then what is a as b plus c?\n", "asr_s": 3.75, "expert_s": 8.46, "expert_input_samples": 240000, "expert_input_s": 15.0, "expert_input_sha256": "91a8f0bd071bda9f8676195ec17c1d4ba2cca1a508776a7a9572056ffe685391", "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": 9.073, "relay_synth_ms": 84948, "onset_chunk": 14, "eot_seen": false, "n_speak_chunks": 1, "feed_lag_max_ms": 2016, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 2016, "audio_files": {"relay": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0149_conservative_relay.wav", "sha256": "ba004d1fdcd2ac2111f64ff499b2d411ab743ad24d6f44b52544047e0fc08ea6", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 218.52}, "candidate": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0149_conservative_candidate.wav", "sha256": "be9a3ccecb3b34aa0381ced8c8bb642e5c3c09b289901eb02905d455094c9ae2", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 1.0}, "stall": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0149_conservative_stall.wav", "sha256": "9d43a4ee0602f73e644335afdae5418fabcd87679faf7dd4c061d2862325adeb", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 2.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.1, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.101, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.055, 3.1, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.056, 4.102, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.057, 5.103, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.058, 6.106, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.057, 7.103, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.057, 8.104, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.058, 9.105, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.058, 10.104, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.059, 11.105, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.06, 12.106, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.059, 13.105, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.06, 14.106, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.059, 15.661, 0, 24000, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 18.18, 18.803, 0, 30720, 1]], "status": "completed", "error": null, "ts": {"feed_start": 0.0, "input_end": 16.712, "last_real_feed_done": null, "onset": 15.661, "gate_read_done": 15.661, "fire": 15.661, "candidate_first_pcm": 15.661, "stall_note": 15.662, "stall_first_pcm": 18.016, "local_first_pcm": null, "wait_start": 18.803, "expert_req": 15.662, "expert_resp": 27.876, "relay_synth_start": 27.877, "relay_first_pcm": 28.