{"id": "q0279", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2657570629, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "Using the steam tables, calculate the velocity in a nozzle at a pointwhere the pressure is 40Psiawhen the superheated steamflows from a boiler. The initial boiler conditions are P(pressure) = 80Psia, T(temperature) = 500°F, and V(velocity) = 0.\n\nA. 2100 ft/sec\nB. 2200 ft/sec\nC. 1500 ft/sec\nD. 1950 ft/sec\nE. 1819 ft/sec\nF. 1600 ft/sec\nG. 1900 ft/sec\nH. 1700 ft/sec\nI. 2000 ft/sec\nJ. 1400 ft/sec\n\nAnswer with the correct option letter and its content.", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0279.wav", "input_sha256": "c7dac7ac0191f9d7a49322f72f371ba7e0175dee840cea2c57ae84b54e97eb24", "input_samples": 571800, "input_s": 35.737, "n_real_chunks": 36, "score": 0.8913, "act": 0.9999, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "Using the steam table s, we start by identifying the initial conditions. The superheated steam leaves the boiler at 80 PS IA and 50 0 degrees Fahren heit with zero velocity. We then look for the enthalpy value corresponding to these conditions. From there, we use the energy balance equation for a nozz le, which relates en thalpy change to kinetic energy change since potential energy is negligible. At the nozzle exit where pressure drops to 40 PS IA, we find the new enthalpy from the steam tables and calculate the resulting velocity using the formula derived from the first law of thermodynamics. After performing the calculations, the velocity comes out to approximately 190 0 feet per second. So the correct answer is G, 1 90 0 feet per second.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 35, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 31, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0279_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "934f7998dc5698e8f092f08074282a8d621bd6e2f51a844f32cea1bab2550f9e", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 31.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.1, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.1, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.055, 3.1, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.056, 4.102, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 5.0, 5.056, 5.102, 1, 0, 0], [5, 1, 6.0, 6.057, 6.103, 1, 0, 0], [6, 1, 7.0, 7.056, 7.102, 1, 0, 0], [7, 1, 8.0, 8.057, 8.102, 1, 0, 0], [8, 1, 9.0, 9.056, 9.102, 1, 0, 0], [9, 1, 10.0, 10.058, 10.103, 1, 0, 0], [10, 1, 11.0, 11.057, 11.103, 1, 0, 0], [11, 1, 12.0, 12.06, 12.106, 1, 0, 0], [12, 1, 13.0, 13.059, 13.105, 1, 0, 0], [13, 1, 14.0, 14.059, 14.105, 1, 0, 0], [14, 1, 15.0, 15.059, 15.104, 1, 0, 0], [15, 1, 16.0, 16.059, 16.105, 1, 0, 0], [16, 1, 17.0, 17.058, 17.104, 1, 0, 0], [17, 1, 18.0, 18.059, 18.105, 1, 0, 0], [18, 1, 19.0, 19.06, 19.105, 1, 0, 0], [19, 1, 20.0, 20.06, 20.106, 1, 0, 0], [20, 1, 21.0, 21.061, 21.107, 1, 0, 0], [21, 1, 22.0, 22.061, 22.107, 1, 0, 0], [22, 1, 23.0, 23.06, 23.106, 1, 0, 0], [23, 1, 24.0, 24.061, 24.107, 1, 0, 0], [24, 1, 25.0, 25.061, 25.107, 1, 0, 0], [25, 1, 26.0, 26.062, 26.107, 1, 0, 0], [26, 1, 27.0, 27.061, 27.107, 1, 0, 0], [27, 1, 28.0, 28.062, 28.108, 1, 0, 0], [28, 1, 29.0, 29.062, 29.108, 1, 0, 0], [29, 1, 30.0, 30.059, 30.105, 1, 0, 0], [30, 1, 31.0, 31.06, 31.106, 1, 0, 0], [31, 1, 32.0, 32.06, 32.105, 1, 0, 0], [32, 1, 33.0, 33.06, 33.106, 1, 0, 0], [33, 1, 34.0, 34.061, 34.107, 1, 0, 0], [34, 1, 35.0, 35.061, 35.107, 1, 0, 0], [35, 1, 35.737, 35.798, 36.19, 0, 24000, 0], [36, 0, 36.737, 36.799, 37.377, 0, 24000, 0], [37, 0, 37.737, 37.801, 38.286, 0, 2400