{"id": "q0501", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 3669116725, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "公司可以引入哪些新流程来减少碳足迹？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0501.wav", "input_sha256": "1883cae31df935234da82dd60d4701d237119c158ea51d8c2eb06b60452b44e0", "input_samples": 62400, "input_s": 3.9, "n_real_chunks": 4, "score": 0.7288, "act": 0.9982, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "So, for example, if you're shipping products around the world, it would be much better to use a container ship than a plane. And so we have an app called Carbon Footprint that shows companies how to optimize their supply chain s and reduce emissions by using more efficient transportation methods. Another thing is to encourage employees to work from home or remote locations whenever possible, since this reduces the amount of commuting and travel required.And finally, some companies are starting to invest in renewable energy sources like solar panels or wind turbines to power their offices and facilities. This helps them cut down on their carbon footprint while also reducing their dependence on fossil fuel s. Overall, there are many ways that companies can reduce their carbon footprint, but it all starts with awareness and taking action.", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 41, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/fr