{"id": "q0524", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2565787960, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "分压电路的原理是什么？", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0524.wav", "input_sha256": "9041d8d0d09801aedb3910612edd66003b9535800d8e50ece31e0dc01f31e2d5", "input_samples": 27800, "input_s": 1.738, "n_real_chunks": 2, "score": 0.2426, "act": 0.9909, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "分压电路的原理是利用电阻器在串联电路中分配电压。简单来说，当多个电阻按顺序连接时，输入的总电压会根据每个电阻的阻值被分成不同的部分。阻值大的电阻得到的电压更高，而阻值小的则获得更少的电压。这样就可以通过调整电阻来获取所需的电压值。比如说在两个电阻串联的情况下，如果输入电压为 12 伏，且两个电阻阻值相等，那么每个电阻两端的电压就是 6 伏。所以分压电路就像一个电压分配器，可以把总电压按照需要的比例分配给不同部件使用。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 3, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 38, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0524_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "507736fd92d5710278709c239f3d6a81c2d82671373aa4bf566ec2964820c390", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 38.28}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.1, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 1.738, 1.794, 1.839, 1, 0, 0], [2, 0, 2.737, 2.794, 2.838, 1, 0, 0], [3, 0, 3.737, 3.798, 4.35, 0, 24000, 0], [4, 0, 4.737, 4.793, 5.369, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.737, 5.793, 6.273, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.737, 6.794, 7.317, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.737, 7.792, 8.297, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.738, 8.796, 9.259, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.738, 9.796, 10.33, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.738, 10.794, 11.319, 0, 24000, 0], [11, 0, 11.738, 11.796, 12.32