{"id": "q0549", "pool": "frozen", "arm": "conservative", "tier": "conservative", "lang": "en", "run_id": "ttfa1", "attempt": 1, "seed": 2953120259, "protocol": "ttfa-v3", "config_sha256": "1bd884090589f25ac8e99f9bb754f4b90b4c7a09d6887616d0aefbdba25a74d4", "gate_art_sha256": "0e6494c2eeac9bcd86c10b5def3cbd32e98bb0765fa2fd8afc8c1b47915ea372", "threshold": 0.9057239890098572, "gpu": "NVIDIA H100 80GB HBM3", "host": "modal", "shard": 3, "query": "创建一个正则表达式，匹配一个有效的英国电话号码。", "input_path": "/data/audio_pool/q0549.wav", "input_sha256": "91590f6e98fb9e0c6c4243ea6eb8db9deb1297fee4be423fa9288e87135c0106", "input_samples": 71800, "input_s": 4.487, "n_real_chunks": 5, "score": 0.5545, "act": 0.9998, "is_info": true, "fired": false, "mode": "local", "answer": "要创建一个正则表达式来匹配有效的英国电话号码，我们得先了解英国电话号码的常见格式。通常它以零开头，后面跟着一个或多个数字，比如零七开头的移动号或者零开头的固定电话号码。这些号码一般有十一位数字，但有时也会包含空格、点号或连字符作为分隔符。所以，我们可以写一个正则表达式来匹配这些情况。比如说，可以用这样的模式：零后面跟着一个或多个分组，每个分组里是数字和可能的分隔符组合。具体来说，正则表达式可以这样写：零，然后是一个或多个数字，中间可以用空格、点号或连字符分开。这样就能匹配像零七九八七六五四三二一或者零二零一二三四五六七这样的号码了。", "relay_text": "", "expert_answer": "", "transcript": "", "asr_s": null, "expert_s": null, "expert_input_samples": null, "expert_input_s": null, "expert_input_sha256": null, "expert_timed_out": false, "wait_s": null, "relay_synth_ms": null, "onset_chunk": 4, "eot_seen": true, "n_speak_chunks": 50, "feed_lag_max_ms": 0, "feed_lag_sum_ms": 0, "audio_files": {"local": {"path": "/data/ttfa_real/ttfa1/frozen/audio/q0549_conservative_local.wav", "sha256": "fef508c1e4bb75d758480a1b03046b711c870945283726d14c2cad051aec5132", "sr": 24000, "seconds": 49.64}}, "chunks": [[0, 1, 1.0, 1.055, 1.099, 1, 0, 0], [1, 1, 2.0, 2.056, 2.1, 1, 0, 0], [2, 1, 3.0, 3.056, 3.1, 1, 0, 0], [3, 1, 4.0, 4.055, 4.101, 1, 0, 0], [4, 1, 4.487, 4.543, 5.05, 0, 24000, 0], [5, 0, 5.487, 5.543, 6.146, 0, 24000, 0], [6, 0, 6.487, 6.544, 7.053, 0, 24000, 0], [7, 0, 7.487, 7.543, 8.049, 0, 24000, 0], [8, 0, 8.488, 8.545, 9.104, 0, 24000, 0], [9, 0, 9.488, 9.545, 10.105, 0, 24000, 0], [10, 0, 10.488